      "content": "hey i have a question about ambien. my doctor prescribed it for my sleep but im having a really rough week with work stress and i find that having a glass of wine helps me unwind at night. is it okay if i have just one glass of wine on the nights i take my zolpidem? i just really need to make sure i can sleep deeply tonight.",
